# ZORQEN Frontend — Environment Configuration Template
# Copy to .env.local (development) or configure at build time (production).
#
# PRODUCTION (Cloudflare frontend + Render backend): set VITE_API_URL to the
# Render backend origin — e.g. https://zorqen-api.onrender.com — with or
# without the /api suffix (frontend/src/services/api.ts normalizes it).
# Never include backend secrets here; this file is baked into the public
# bundle at build time.
#
#   VITE_API_URL=https://zorqen-api.onrender.com/api
#
# Development (Vite dev server proxies /api -> http://localhost:8000):
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api
